10 REM THE NEXT MACHINE REPAIR STEP FROM THE CHECK RESULTS, THE FIRST THAT APPLIES
12 REM 0 NONE, 1 ISOLATE THE POWER, 2 REPAIR OR REPLACE THE PART,
14 REM 3 RESTORE THE POWER AND RUN THE SELF-CHECK, 4 RECORD AND SCHEDULE
20 INPUT F, P, X, T
30 IF F < 0 THEN 300
40 IF F > 1 THEN 300
50 IF P < 0 THEN 300
60 IF P > 1 THEN 300
70 IF X < 0 THEN 300
80 IF X > 1 THEN 300
90 IF T < 0 THEN 300
100 IF T > 1 THEN 300
110 LET S = 0
120 IF F = 0 THEN 200
130 IF X = 1 THEN 170
140 LET S = 1
150 IF P = 0 THEN 200
160 LET S = 2
165 GOTO 200
170 LET S = 3
180 IF T = 0 THEN 200
190 LET S = 4
200 PRINT S
210 GOTO 310
300 PRINT "REFUSED"
310 END
